 "glbPatch": {
  "reason": "authenticity lane-B 2026-10-08: AttackFront/ShootFront re-authored to the DEF overhead raise (f1) and forward chop (f2-f3) with follow-through, wings lifted up and back (f2-f4) instead of wrapping forward over the body; Defence holds the sword raised upright behind with the shield forward. Mesh: the sword blade was welded to the legs by weights (21 blade verts carried RightLeg/LeftLeg+foot weight, 2 blade-root seam twins carried RightUpLeg/Hips), so any sword raise tore the blade faces; both groups move to RightHand. Tear gate 651 -> 19 (worst edge 3.507 -> 2.492). 2026-10-08 check pass: head looks ahead through MoveStart/Move/MoveEnd (in flight it pitched 30 deg down at the ground at the stride ends and leaned 9 deg sideways).",
